{"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "diff", "ucas": "diff x^2*y x y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "diff", "vars": ["x", "y"], "order": 2, "derivative": "2x"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 200, "max_diff": 2.5290844042146857e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "∂²/∂y∂x x^2*y = 2x\n  holds wherever the formula is defined\n  check: each order matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 3e-13)\n"}
