{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "grad", "ucas": "grad x^2 + y^2 at 1, 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "grad", "gradient": [{"var": "x", "derivative": "2x"}, {"var": "y", "derivative": "2y"}], "at_value": [2, 4], "at_norm": 4.47213595499958}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 200, "max_diff": 3.9970424744006895e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "∇ x^2 + y^2 = (2x, 2y)\n  ∂/∂x x^2 + y^2 = 2x\n  ∂/∂y x^2 + y^2 = 2y\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 4e-13)\n  at (x = 1, y = 2): (2, 4), |∇| = 4.472135955\n"}
{"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "hessian", "ucas": "hessian x^2 - y^2 at 0, 0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "hessian", "matrix": [["2", "0"], ["0", "-2"]], "det": "-4", "at_classification": "saddle point", "at_det": -4}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 400, "max_diff": 2.1279719222248247e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "Hessian of x^2 - y^2 (row i, column j: ∂²/∂j∂i):\n  [ 2   0  ]   ∂/∂x\n  [ 0   -2 ]   ∂/∂y\n  det = -4\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 400 points (max relative difference 2e-13)\n  symmetric (the mixed partials agree) at 100 of 100 sample pairs\n  at (x = 0, y = 0):\n  [ 2          0          ]\n  [ 0          -2         ]\n  det = -4\n  the gradient is 0 and the Hessian is indefinite: a saddle point\n"}
{"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplacian", "ucas": "laplacian x^2 - y^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplacian", "laplacian": "0", "harmonic": true}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 400, "max_diff": 4.1189643443053117e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "∇² x^2 - y^2 = 0\n  ∂²/∂x² x^2 - y^2 = 2\n  ∂²/∂y² x^2 - y^2 = -2\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 400 points (max relative difference 4e-13)\n  x^2 - y^2 is harmonic: its Laplacian is 0 at all 200 sample points (and symbolically 0)\n"}
{"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "jacobian", "ucas": "jacobian x*y, x + y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "jacobian", "wrt": ["x", "y"], "matrix": [["y", "x"], ["1", "1"]], "det": "y - x"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 400, "max_diff": 3.363682367849575e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "Jacobian of (x*y, x + y) wrt (x, y): row i = the gradient of function i\n  [ y   x ]\n  [ 1   1 ]\n  det = y - x\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 400 points (max relative difference 3e-13)\n"}
{"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "wronskian", "ucas": "wronskian sin(x), cos(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "wronskian", "var": "x", "matrix": [["sin(x)", "cos(x)"], ["cos(x)", "-sin(x)"]], "wronskian": "-1", "independent": true, "witness_x": -0.05000000000000071, "witness_w": -1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 402, "max_diff": 2.896608734120898e-15, "passed": true}], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "W != 0 at a sample point"}, "files": [], "text": "Wronskian matrix of sin(x), cos(x) (row k: the k-th derivatives wrt x)\n  [ sin(x)   cos(x)  ]   the functions\n  [ cos(x)   -sin(x) ]   d/dx\n  W = det = -1\n  (W equals the numeric determinant at all 200 sample points of [-10, 10])\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 402 points (max relative difference 3e-15)\n  linearly independent: W(-1/20) = -1 != 0, so the functions are independent on every interval containing x = -1/20\n"}
{"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit sin(x)/x at 0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 1, "text": "1"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}, {"kind": "numeric_right", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of sin(x)/x as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (cos(x))/(1) = lim cos(x)\n  = 1 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}
{"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit 1/x as x -> 0+", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "+", "limit": {"kind": "+inf", "text": "inf"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "limit of 1/x as x -> 0+ (from the right):\n  1/x -> inf (the numerator -> 1, x -> 0+)\n  = inf\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 10, 160, 2560, 40960, 655360, 20971520\n    the values grow without bound (+): agrees\n"}
{"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit 1/x at 0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "both", "left": {"kind": "-inf", "text": "-inf"}, "right": {"kind": "+inf", "text": "inf"}, "limit": {"kind": "does not exist", "text": "the one-sided limits differ"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "limit of 1/x as x -> 0:\n  from the left:\n  1/x -> -inf (the numerator -> 1, x -> 0-)\n  = -inf\n  from the right:\n  1/x -> inf (the numerator -> 1, x -> 0+)\n  = inf\n  the one-sided limits differ: the (two-sided) limit does not exist\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): -10, -160, -2560, -40960, -655360, -20971520\n    the values grow without bound (-): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 10, 160, 2560, 40960, 655360, 20971520\n    the values grow without bound (+): agrees\n"}
{"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit (1 + 1/x)^x at (inf)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "inf", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 2.7182818284590455, "text": "2.718281828"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 4.440892098500626e-16, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of (1/x + 1)^x as x -> inf:\n  (1/x + 1)^x = exp((x)*log(1/x + 1))\n  0*inf: x*log(1/x + 1) = (log(1/x + 1))/(1/x)\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (-1/(x^2*(1/x + 1)))/(-1/x^2) = lim x^2/(x^2*(1/x + 1))\n  at inf: x^2 ~ 1|x|^2, x^2*(1/x + 1) ~ 1|x|^2\n  = 2.718281828\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 2.59374246, 2.709835576, 2.717751104, 2.718248647, 2.718279755, 2.718281764\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 2.71828182846 (estimated error 3e-16): agrees\n"}
{"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor exp(x) order 3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 0, "order": 3, "polynomial": "1 + x + x^2/2 + x^3/6", "coefficients": ["1", "1", "1/2", "1/6"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 4, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of exp(x) at x = 0, through order 3:\n  exp(x) = 1 + x + x^2/2 + x^3/6 + O(x^4)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 1 1 1/2 1/6\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 4.25e-06 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 2.63e-07 at ± 1/20, 1.64e-08 at ± 1/40 (shrinks like h^4.0; expected >= 4)\n"}
{"id": 15, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor log(x) at 1 order 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 1, "order": 2, "polynomial": "x - 1 - (x - 1)^2/2", "coefficients": ["0", "1", "-1/2"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 3, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Taylor series of log(x) at x = 1, through order 2:\n  log(x) = x - 1 - (x - 1)^2/2 + O((x - 1)^3)\n  as x -> 1; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(1)/k!: 0 1 -1/2\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 0.000361 at x = 1 ± 1/10, 4.33e-05 at ± 1/20, 5.31e-06 at ± 1/40 (shrinks like h^3.0; expected >= 3)\n"}
{"id": 16, "ok": true, "cmd": "integrate", "ucas": "integrate x^2 sin(x) wrt x from 0 to pi", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "integrate", "var": "x", "integrand": "x^2*sin(x)", "antiderivative": "2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x)", "definite": {"from": 0, "to": 3.141592653589793, "symbolic": 5.869604401089359, "numeric": 5.869604401089359, "error_estimate": 6.456564841198295e-14, "evaluations": 15, "value": 5.869604401089359}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "derivative", "points": 401, "max_diff": 8.881784197001252e-16, "passed": true, "text": "d/dx of the antiderivative against the integrand"}, {"kind": "numeric_integral", "points": 15, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "F(b) - F(a) against adaptive Gauss-Kronrod"}], "files": [], "text": "∫ x^2*sin(x) dx\n  = 2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x) + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [0, 3.14159] (max difference 8.9e-16)\n  from 0 to 3.14159: F(3.14159) - F(0) = 5.86960440108936\n  numeric (adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15, 15 evaluations): 5.86960440108936, estimated error 6.5e-14\n  the two agree to 0\n"}
