{"id": 22, "ok": true, "cmd": "closed", "ucas": "it(n: int in 1..1000) = { x = n; k = 0; while x > 1 { x = x / 2; k += 1 }; k }\nclosed it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "closed", "loops": [{"loop": "loop(while x > 1; x = n then x/2; k = 0 then k + 1).k", "closed_form": "n > 1 ? 63 - int(clz(u64(n))) : 0", "accepted": true, "checked": true, "method": ["constant body", "accumulator", "trip count"]}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "iteration", "points": 1000, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "against direct iteration on every point of the domain"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "equals direct iteration on every point of the domain"}, "files": [], "text": "loop(while x > 1; x = n then x/2; k = 0 then k + 1).k\n  = n > 1 ? 63 - int(clz(u64(n))) : 0\n  method: constant body, accumulator, trip count\n  trip count n > 1 ? 63 - int(clz(u64(n))) : 0 (checked against the loop at 1000 points)\n  check: equals direct iteration at all 1000 points of the domain\n"}
